# Programs whose verdict rests on exactly one library contract.
#
# Used by tools/contract_monotonicity.py: perturbing that contract upward must
# weaken TRUE to UNKNOWN and never change it to a different verdict. Sampling
# ordinary benchmarks does not work, because their verdicts rarely depend on a
# single contract and every perturbation comes out inert.
#
# Format: <glob> <property>
ajave/contracts/*.yml no-runtime-exception
